{"4827270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frog Fall", "steam_appid": 4827270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog Fall wraps the expressive movement of a 2D momentum-based platformer onto the surface of a vast 3D labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of frog using c-stick in front of awesome vista doing stupid idol animation]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together jumps, rolls, and bounces across walls, ceilings, arches, and impossible ruins as you master the rules of gravity, inertia, and orientation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of frog platforming sickly]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observation and experimentation are key. The background is never just decoration: distant structures may reveal secret areas of the world you have yet to reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of a frog in a distinctive location]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mechanical skill and spatial reasoning to untangle navigational Gordian knots, plan new routes, and return to familiar places from entirely new angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of frog in same place but in a different orientation]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bwehnah swehrteh mohkohsoh</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of frog dying stupidly]</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog Fall wraps the expressive movement of a 2D momentum-based platformer onto the surface of a vast 3D labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of frog using c-stick in front of awesome vista doing stupid idol animation]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together jumps, rolls, and bounces across walls, ceilings, arches, and impossible ruins as you master the rules of gravity, inertia, and orientation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of frog platforming sickly]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observation and experimentation are key. The background is never just decoration: distant structures may reveal secret areas of the world you have yet to reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of a frog in a distinctive location]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mechanical skill and spatial reasoning to untangle navigational Gordian knots, plan new routes, and return to familiar places from entirely new angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of frog in same place but in a different orientation]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bwehnah swehrteh mohkohsoh</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif of frog dying stupidly]</p>", "short_description": "Eskweenkleh Brahvoh, I made you to escape this labyrinthine prison. Forget their gravity; you bring your own. Embrace confusion; leap over the impossible, roll on, and, kohn ehl fahbohr dehdyohs, bounce high enough to charm the world’s corpse.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827270/e252de920260ba091ac4d3c179d09216a7bf02b3/header.jpg?t=1784171063", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827270/354880452c4619f3af45397209c8fbc15c4a4a63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784171063", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4827270/354880452c4619f3af45397209c8fbc15c4a4a63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784171063", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Target specs to be announced<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Target specs to be announced<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Colita de Rana"], "publishers": ["Colita de Rana"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linu